 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.5.8-rc17 — Live lobby board
+
+Command → **Lobby**: everyone in your instance at a glance.
+- Labeled people first, then staff, new group members (joined in the last week) and people not in the group; everyone else by time here.
+- Chips for labels, UnderWeb roles, NEW, "Not in group", friends and your notes (hover for the latest).
+- Counts at the top and quick filters: not in group, new, friends, staff, labeled.
+- One-click **Invite to group** for people not in it (only in our instances), add a note, report, or open their profile.
+- Group membership is checked gently in the background (one request at a time, remembered for the session) only while the board is on screen.
+- **UWX never group-invites someone with a shared bad-news label** — the automatic recruiter skips them and the button isn't offered.
+
 ## 0.5.7-rc16 — Staff tools: undo, dashboard, notes, Discord alerts, recruiting stats
 
 - **Undo**: Ban and Remove wait 10 seconds with an Undo button (in the pop-up and at the top of the Groups tab) before anything is sent to VRChat. Undone actions are logged as "undone". Unban runs right away.
